"⟪k:0⟫And it came from the back hall of this very mansion.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Didja know, they say it used "
"to be a chapel?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 ⟪k:1⟫안쪽 홀. ⟪k:2⟫거기 말이야, ⟪k:3⟫들리는 말론 ⟪k:4⟫원래는 교회였다더라.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫알아?"

